Cell["\<\
Computes NCDT invariants for brane tilings following Mozgovoy Reineke \
0809.0117, Li Yamazaki 2003.08909 and Descombes 2106.02518
hMat[[i,j,m]] is the weight of the m-th arrow from i to j, subject to vertex \
and relaxed loop constraints
\
\>", "Text",
